crabpot is a rewrite of that project in Rust. Its source has been changed
from the original throughout.

The one part taken in as it is: crates/crabpot-windows/srt-win/ holds upstream's
`srt-win` crate, byte for byte at commit
aceba124fd725f4a43d7016ed3f5651d61f83115, with the changes listed in
crates/crabpot-windows/PATCHES.md. It carries the same Apache License, Version
2.0, and ADR-0005 records why crabpot ships it under its own name.
